  "content": "\n\n<h1>附魔提取器</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fenchantment-extractor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/enchantment-extractor?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a></p>\n<p>從護甲、工具與武器中提取附魔！使用附魔書的結果，已修復鐵砧相關問題！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 錯誤/問題</h2>\n<p>請將任何錯誤或問題回報至 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🛠️ 合成配方</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OvtX6mK.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 指令</h2>\n<p>給予：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot enchantment_extractor:enchantment_extractor</code></pre>\n<p>停用：</p>\n<pre><code>/datapack disable \"file/enchantment-extractor.zip\"</code></pre>\n<p>啟用：</p>\n<pre><code>/datapack enable \"file/enchantment-extractor.zip\"</code></pre>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 授權條款</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantment-extractor-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🎁 伺服器託管</h2>\n<p>自行架設伺服器可能是一個非常耗時、繁瑣且昂貴的過程。</p>\n<p>但透過 BisectHosting，您只需點擊幾次即可擁有自己的伺服器！他們提供全天候客服與快速回應，絕不會讓問題阻礙您的腳步！感興趣嗎？我們為您準備了專屬優惠！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"伺服器託管\"></p>",
